  "laws": [
    "Acyclic dependencies with deterministic ordering",
    "Overlapping writes execute serially; parallel only independently proven disjoint effects",
    "Every node binds actual executor/options/source hashes/scope/read-write sets and evidence",
    "Change any input or scope and invalidate dependent proofs",
    "Refusal/failure stops dependent nodes; no best-effort promotion",
    "Bound cycles/fixed-point search and reject oscillation; DAG itself stays acyclic",
    "At most one serial terminal PROMOTION; planning data grants no execution or remote authority"
  ],
  "existing_bindings": [
    "OpenRewrite YAML recipeList for ordered recipe execution",
    "M3RecipeDag.parse and M3RecipeDagManifest for structural plans; not generic dispatch",
    "M3CatalogueDagRecipe sealed template is available but target OpenRewriteRecipeDagPlan is not installed in inspected checkouts",
    "ai mechanical registry compose only accepts its registered IDs, not arbitrary FQNs"
  ],
  "existing_parser_boundary": "The generic shapes above are not M3RecipeDag TSV instances. That existing parser requires exactly one PROMOTION plus required fan-in; satisfy its actual schema when bound. At-most-one is a safety constraint on these unbound shapes, not that parser contract."
